    "perplexity": {
      "description": "It's Only About You If You Think It Is\" is JMSN's 2025 album that showcases the Detroit artist's mastery of funk and soul production. Released in October 2025, the 10-track project spans 42 minutes and was entirely written, produced, mixed, and arranged by JMSN at White Room Studios in Los Angeles, with mastering by Randy Merrill at Sterling Sound. The album features JMSN's signature blend of groovy instrumentation and introspective lyricism, with opening track \"Blow The Spot Up\" immediately establishing the project's raw energy through aggressive vocals, guitar work, and percussion that set a confrontational tone.\n\nThe album explores themes of emotional detachment, frustration, and interpersonal conflict with unflinching honesty. Tracks like \"I Don't Even Think About U\" and \"Dirty Dog\" showcase JMSN's ability to layer provocative lyrics over hypnotic funk grooves, creating a sonic landscape that balances musicality with emotional intensity. The project demonstrates JMSN's evolution as both a musician and lyricist, moving beyond the intimate production style he's known for to embrace a more assertive, funk-driven aesthetic while maintaining the meticulous craftsmanship that defines his work.",
